{"hymn":"FY113","parent":"E1325","quality":"adapted","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":7},"title":"Le Dieu éternel a un dessein","subtitle":"","syl":{"n1":"Le","n2":"Dieu","n3":["é","i"],"n4":["ter","m"],"n5":["nel","t"],"n6":"a","n7":"un","n8":"des‿sein,","n9":["For","i"],"n10":["mé","t"],"n11":"dans","n12":["l’é","i"],"n13":["ter‿ni","m"],"n14":["té‿pas","m"],"n15":["sée,","t"],"n16":["Joi","i"],"n17":["gnant","t"],"n18":["l’é","i"],"n19":["ter","m"],"n20":["ni","m"],"n21":["té","t"],"n22":["fu","i"],"n23":["ture;","t"],"n24":"Entre","n25":"ces","n26":"deux","n27":"le","n28":"temps","n29":["est‿en","i"],"n30":["tré.","t"],"n31":"Par","n32":"ce‿temps","n33":"il","n34":["y","i"],"n35":["’a","t"],"n36":["le‿pro","i"],"n38":["ces","m"],"n39":["sus,","t"],"n40":"Temps","n41":"pour","n42":"son","n43":["ac","i"],"n44":["com","m"],"n46":["plis","m"],"n47":["sement;","t"],"n48":"Nous","n49":"n’y","n50":"sommes","n51":"que","n52":"des","n53":["pè","i"],"n54":["le","m"],"n55":["rins","t"],"n56":"Pour","n57":["l’é","i"],"n58":["ter","m"],"n59":["ni","m"],"n60":["té","t"],"n61":["des‿ti","i"],"n62":["nés.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Dieu aimerait un group’ de personnes","Bâties ensemble au cœur de Son plan,","Mélangées, tissées, coordonnées,","C’est Son vase, c’est le nouvel homme.","Dieu veut venir remplir ce vase","Avec Ses voies, Sa vie, Sa nature,","Mélangeant l’Esprit et notre esprit","Pour Sa joie et pour Sa gloire."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Dieu œuvra en trois directions","Pour Son plan si merveilleux :","C’est le Père, le Fils et l’Esprit","Pour Se dispenser Lui-même en nous","La création compose le cadre :","Les cieux la terre y sont pour Son plan ;","C’est pour ça que Dieu créa le corps,","L’âme et l’esprit – l’homme tripartite."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Dans le plan de Dieu, c’est notre esprit","Qui est le centre et le noyau.","En invoquant le nom de Jésus,","Avec lui notre esprit s’unit.","Du centre à la périphérie,","Dieu veut saturer notre être,","Faire Sa demeure en notre cœur,","En renouvelant notre âme"]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Dans la vie nous sommes ainsi bâtis,","Puis dans l’amour sommes tissés.","Dieu maintenant Son plan accomplit,","Terminant ce qu’Il a commencé.","Seigneur en nous ajoute-Toi","Afin d’être bâtis par Toi","En ce vase corporatif","Exclusiv’ment de Dieu rempli."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["Le produit, l’accomplissement","C’est l’Église en gloir’ manifestée,","Consommation de ce grand dessein","Planifié dans l’éternité.","Dieu aura Son vase corporatif,","Qui contiendra toute Sa gloire ;","Seigneur nous sommes absolus pour Ton dessein","Ton but en nous Tu atteins."]}]}